Always divide the **bigger number** by the smaller one:
```
a=48, b=18 → a>=b → a = 48%18 = 12
a=12, b=18 → b>a  → b = 18%12 = 6
a=12, b=6  → a>=b → a = 12%6  = 0
Loop stops! (a == 0)
```

