## Step by Step Trace

### Example: GCD(48, 18)

| Step | a | b | Who is bigger | Operation |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Start | 48 | 18 | a >= b | a = 48%18 = 12 |
| Step 2 | 12 | 18 | b > a | b = 18%12 = 6 |
| Step 3 | 12 | 6 | a >= b | a = 12%6 = 0 |
| Stop | 0 | 6 | a == 0 | Answer = **6** |

---

### Example: GCD(56, 98)

| Step | a | b | Operation |
|---|---|---|---|
| Start | 56 | 98 | b = 98%56 = 42 |
| Step 2 | 56 | 42 | a = 56%42 = 14 |
| Step 3 | 14 | 42 | b = 42%14 = 0 |
| Stop | 14 | 0 | Answer = **14** |

