## Time Complexity

```cpp
// O(log(min(a,b)))
```

| Method | Speed | Example GCD(1000000, 1) |
|---|---|---|
| Subtraction | O(max(a,b)) | 1,000,000 steps 😱 |
| Modulo (this code) | O(log min) | ~20 steps ✅ |

Modulo is **much faster** than subtraction!

